target/

# nucl-parquet-mcp path-depends on the sibling nucl-parquet crate, so a committed
# lockfile pins the library version and goes stale on every nucl-parquet release —
# the pre-commit clippy hook then relocks it and blocks the release PR (it blocked
# #244 until a manual relock). cargo regenerates it at build/publish, and the
# publish job uses plain `cargo publish` (no --locked), so nothing depends on it
# being committed.
Cargo.lock
